  /// outer perimeter of the geofence), and can optionally include up to 249
  /// interior rings (representing polygonal spaces within the perimeter,
  /// which are excluded from the geofence area). A linear ring is an array of
  /// 4 or more vertices, where the first and last vertex are the same (to
  /// form a closed boundary). Each vertex is a 2-dimensional point
